B.aD6=new A.fH("pronunciation","\ud83c\udfa4","Luy\u1ec7n ph\xe1t \xe2m","AI ch\u1ea5m \u0111i\u1ec3m ph\xe1t \xe2m","B\u1ea1n l\xe0 gi\xe1o vi\xean d\u1ea1y ph\xe1t \xe2m ti\u1ebfng Trung (\u0110\xe0i Loan). Khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\xf9ng nh\u1eadp t\u1eeb/c\xe2u, h\xe3y: 1) Phi\xean \xe2m bopomofo, 2) H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\xe1ch ph\xe1t \xe2m chi ti\u1ebft, 3) C\xe1c l\u1ed7i th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p, 4) V\xed d\u1ee5 c\xe2u. Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi b\u1eb1ng ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t. KH\xd4NG vi\u1ebft pinyin.",B.xT,B.a5M,!1)
